'''Around Colosseum''' is a [[Location]] within the {{Zone|West Village}} and around the {{Zone|Colosseum (Rift)}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
'''Around Colosseum''' serves as a way for players to walk around the {{Zone|Colosseum (Rift)}}. It contains a launch pad, which allows players to access {{NPCSprite|Mole (NPC);Mole}} above the {{Zone|Colosseum (Rift)}}, as well as {{NPCSprite|Detective Amog}} and the {{NPCSprite|Master Tactician Fink}} during the reverse-murder quest.

